  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "**简体中文** · [English](README.en.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "RSS",
      "text": "**自己选来源，把订阅整理成好读的信息流。**\n\n[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-rss) [](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-rss) [](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-rss)\n\n**[安装使用](#安装) · [使用流程](#开始使用) · [完整说明](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-rss/blob/master/docs/REFERENCE.zh.md)**"
    },
    {
      "section": "RSS",
      "text": "<picture>\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 640px)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-rss/master/docs/assets/intro/workflow-zh-mobile-dark.svg\">\n  <source media=\"(max-width: 640px)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-rss/master/docs/assets/intro/workflow-zh-mobile-light.svg\">\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-rss/master/docs/assets/intro/workflow-zh-dark.svg\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-rss/master/docs/assets/intro/workflow-zh-light.svg\" alt=\"自己选来源，把订阅整理成好读的信息流。 · 流程示意\" width=\"100%\">\n</picture>"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- 从五类来源目录开始，也能添加自己的地址。\n- 预览后再订阅；浏览目录不会自动添加来源。\n- 按分类、未读或关键词阅读，并导出 OPML 备份。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "在 DSH 桌面版「插件」面板安装 `dsh-rss`。已配置命令行时也可使用：\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile desktop add dsh-rss\n```\n\n网页版把 `desktop` 改为 `web`；安装后重启对应的 DSH。宿主要求以包声明 `>=0.2.1-rc.3` 为准。"
    },
    {
      "section": "开始使用",
